{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50927","headline":"献题金鳌山 · 吕从庆","name":"献题金鳌山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金鳌腾腾高百丈，昔者曾游东海浪。\n女娲断足奠坤舆，怒身化作安吴嶂。\n骨肉虽变魂魄鲜，千秋万古生云烟。\n闲花老树满馥郁，飞走异类争蹁跹。\n草堂熟对忽诧异，念在神僊广游戏。\n琴高跨鲤如跨驴，初成乘龙较容易。\n我今自号钓鱼郎，丝纶倍比任公长。\n愿言活汝骑脚底，御风直造星辰傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}